      r: ['Correct. With IV access and an unsafe swallow, IV dextrose works in minutes.', 'Correct. Recheck to see it worked; repeat per protocol if it hasn’t.',
        'Incorrect. A confused, drowsy client may aspirate.', 'Incorrect. Insulin would make it worse.', 'Incorrect. Hypoglycemia protocols let the nurse treat immediately.', 'Incorrect. Not safe if the client can’t protect the airway.'],
